{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like big numbers? Sure, got you covered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.poster.avif?t=1760386242\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.webm?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.mp4?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.avif?t=1760386242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.webp?t=1760386242 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice A Million is a roguelike deckbuilder about rolling dice to try and get to a million points. Combine the effects of more than <strong>100 different</strong> <strong>dice</strong> and discover <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. Get through ever-increasing debts and fearsome bosses that will require perfect symbiosis in your bag in order to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to push luck to your side?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.poster.avif?t=1760386242\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.webm?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.mp4?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.avif?t=1760386242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.webp?t=1760386242 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comboing dice alone won't be enough to reach your full synergistic potential. Adorn your hand with more than <strong>80</strong> <strong>unique rings</strong> that will act as your passive items! They're always active and trigger wacky effects in your dice.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Accessorize with some funky rings and get rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.poster.avif?t=1760386242\" width=908 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.webm?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.mp4?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And most importantly...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Break the game</u>\u00a0<i>(It is one of those)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.poster.avif?t=1760386242\" width=988 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.webm?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.mp4?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430340?t=1760386242","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760386242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/5ce3eb83d7ff88366fb18b2704382a58b7e104e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760386242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/5ce3eb83d7ff88366fb18b2704382a58b7e104e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760386242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3497720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Main Features</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated runs, <i>roguelike style</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different paths and endings</strong> to shape your run as you like!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too easy? Try 6 difficult <strong>Power Levels</strong> for maximum replayability</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than <strong>100 dice</strong> with unique effects</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different <strong>enchantments</strong> that could drastically modify the behaviour of your dice</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than <strong>80 rings </strong>with passive effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different <strong>hands (classes)</strong> to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+20 one-time use cards</strong> to help you fight RNG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of <strong>Challenges</strong> to put your skills to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of unlocks</strong> and secret achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Millions of pips</strong></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like big numbers? Sure, got you covered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.poster.avif?t=1760386242\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.webm?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.mp4?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.avif?t=1760386242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.webp?t=1760386242 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice A Million is a roguelike deckbuilder about rolling dice to try and get to a million points. Combine the effects of more than <strong>100 different</strong> <strong>dice</strong> and discover <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. Get through ever-increasing debts and fearsome bosses that will require perfect symbiosis in your bag in order to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to push luck to your side?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.poster.avif?t=1760386242\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.webm?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.mp4?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.avif?t=1760386242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.webp?t=1760386242 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comboing dice alone won't be enough to reach your full synergistic potential. Adorn your hand with more than <strong>80</strong> <strong>unique rings</strong> that will act as your passive items! They're always active and trigger wacky effects in your dice.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Accessorize with some funky rings and get rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.poster.avif?t=1760386242\" width=908 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.webm?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.mp4?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And most importantly...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Break the game</u>\u00a0<i>(It is one of those)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.poster.avif?t=1760386242\" width=988 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.webm?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.mp4?t=1760386242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["countlessnights"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/7f26ffc6d43cbf1ad54ceae34631320681939b01/header.jpg?t=1760386242","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":